bluejetty:00114720:ios.description:
Larry’s Defense is a wave-based strategy defense game where you fight through acts of increasingly difficult enemies, defeat powerful bosses, and ascend to become even stronger.
Every decision matters. Choose the right upgrades, create powerful combinations, and push as far as possible. Each wave becomes harder, testing your strategy and build. Can you survive long enough to defeat the bosses?
Features:
- Tower(less) defense gameplay with wave-based survival;
- RPG mechanics – distribute attribute points to build your unique hero;
- Craft & upgrade equipment to face stronger enemies;
- Unlock and master skills for big damage or clutch defense;
- Ascension – Play forever with the infinite progression (prestige) system;
- Play offline – defend anywhere, anytime;
- Face off against other Larry's in weekly competitions;
- Unlock skins and customize your look;
- Collect them all – Kill and register every ghost enemy in Larry's Ghostdex. 
Can you turn Larry into the ultimate defender? Larry could really use some help..
Perfect for players who love wave survival, tower defense chaos, hero upgrades, and huge boss fights — all wrapped in a goofy, light-hearted adventure.

